    {
     "type": "quote",
     "title": "The Crossing Is the Strategy",
     "content": "\"It is now time to make a strategic decision. The decision is no longer about products. It is about markets, customers, and partners.\" — Geoffrey Moore. The chasm cannot be engineered around. It must be crossed by deliberate market choice, ruthless niche focus, partner-driven whole products, and pragmatist-friendly distribution. Every founder of a discontinuous innovation will eventually stand at the edge. The ones who acknowledge the chasm, pick a beachhead, and ship a 90-day plan will be reading their own case study in a future edition of the book. The rest will be the cautionary tale.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Crossing Is the Strategy</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Be a case study, not a cautionary tale</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"200\" width=\"940\" height=\"540\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"#ffd700\" opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"30\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\">\"</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"360\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">It is now time to make a</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"405\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">strategic decision. The decision</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">is no longer about products.</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"495\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">It is about markets, customers,</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"540\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\">and partners.\"</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"650\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#888\">— Geoffrey Moore, Crossing the Chasm</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">You have the playbook.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pick the beach. Cross the chasm.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Then come back and rewrite the case study.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Cross the chasm — or be the cautionary tale."
     }
    }
